==== Opening the Case ====
The case consists of an upper red half and a lower dark grey half. To open the case, first remove the four phillips screws hidden under the rubber feet. In addition to the screws, the two halves of the case are held together by nine integral catches: two at the front, two along each angled edge, and three along the back. Due to their flimsy construction, it's highly unlikely that the case can be opened without breaking the upper half portion of all three back catches.

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

